    fix(package): exclude SileroVAD README from the MLXAudioVAD target (#250)
    
    SwiftPM treats every non-source file in a target directory as an unhandled
    resource unless it is declared or excluded. Sources/MLXAudioVAD/Models/SileroVAD/README.md
    was not in the target's exclude list (SmartTurn and Sortformer already are), so every
    package that depends on mlx-audio-swift builds with:
    
        warning: 'mlx-audio-swift': found 1 file(s) which are unhandled; explicitly
        declare them as resources or exclude from the target
    
    Add it to the exclude list alongside its siblings.
    
    Co-authored-by: Pietroski <pietroskisoftwarecompany@gmail.com>

